mellow.group.sky=Sky
mellow.group.clouds=Clouds
mellow.group.water=Water
mellow.group.grade=Colour Grade

mellow.desc.sky=How much of Mellow's sky colours replace Radiante PT's. Lower keeps more of the original sky.
mellow.desc.sun_tint=Warms sunlight towards Mellow's golden tint. Lower keeps the light neutral.
mellow.desc.fog=Mellow's haze in the air. Shows with Volumetric Light on; higher is thicker.
mellow.desc.stars=Brightness of Mellow's stars, which take the place of Radiante PT's. 0 hides them.
mellow.desc.aurora=Strength of the aurora in snowy biomes. 0 turns it off.
mellow.desc.aurora_everywhere=Shows the aurora in every biome, not only snowy ones.
mellow.desc.cloud_style=0: no clouds of Mellow's, 1: flat painted clouds, 2: volumetric clouds (costs more).
mellow.desc.cloud_amount=How much of the sky the clouds cover. Rain and thunder add more.
mellow.desc.cloud_opacity=How solid the clouds look. Lower lets more sky through.
mellow.desc.cloud_shadows=How dark the clouds' shadows on the ground are. 0 turns them off.
mellow.desc.cloud_speed=How fast the clouds drift. 0 stops them.
mellow.desc.water=How much of Mellow's water colour replaces Radiante PT's.
mellow.desc.vibrance=Raises dull colours more than strong ones. 1 leaves them as they are.
mellow.desc.saturation=Strength of every colour. 1 leaves them as they are.
mellow.desc.contrast=Separation between light and dark. 1 leaves the picture as it is.
mellow.desc.lut=A colour look over the finished picture: 0 off, 1 Vintage, 2 Mellow, 3 Punchy.

mellow.preset.mellow=Mellow
mellow.preset.mellow.desc=The pack's own look, as Mellow ships it.
mellow.preset.clear=Clear Skies
mellow.preset.clear.desc=Fewer and thinner clouds, lighter haze.
mellow.preset.vivid=Vivid
mellow.preset.vivid.desc=Stronger colour, warmer sun and the Punchy look.
mellow.preset.subtle=Subtle
mellow.preset.subtle.desc=Half of Mellow's colours over Radiante PT's, no extra colour boost.
